        "epId": 2282,
        "name": "香浓土豆泥",
        "desc": "<p>调味加工而成的土豆泥。将土豆捣成细腻的泥状，淋上调味汁，口感润滑，富有味觉层次。无论是作为配菜还是主食，都能轻松满足饥肠辘辘的胃。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2023/04/09/88072335/96b4fc5b66b328a49100290549297943_6872671652025007097.png",
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 2661,
        "name": "奇怪的香浓土豆泥",
        "desc": "<p>调味加工而成的土豆泥。土豆泥里面混杂着一些难以捣碎的土豆块,品尝起来多了几分不太美妙的随机性。</p><p></p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2023/04/09/88072335/b857ea237db0313468bd4eb20c1e8a0a_7701799781961006344.png",
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 2285,
        "name": "美味的香浓土豆泥",
        "desc": "<p>调味加工而成的土豆泥。伴随着丝滑的土豆泥入口,一抹香浓在舌尖化开,紧接着鲜味与奶味交织迸发。如此曼妙的滋味,简直难以想象出自土豆这种家常的食材。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2023/04/09/88072335/74d3456f0b26c58c40fd457e01ea8933_6742081787763264756.png",
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "奶油蘑菇汤"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "相关食谱"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 4222,
        "name": "食谱：奶油蘑菇汤",
        "desc": "<p>步骤详实的食谱，记载着「奶油蘑菇汤」的制作方法。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2023/08/28/88072335/60c9c277139b43907167e6452d409874_5137998974188187372.png",
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "需要食材"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 1555,
        "name": "蘑菇",
        "desc": "生命力旺盛的常见菌类。只要拥有适宜的荫蔽与水分，在何处都能蓬勃生长。",
        "iconUrl": "https://bbs.hoyolab.com/hoyowiki/picture/object/Mushroom_icon.png",
        "amount": 3,
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 602,
        "name": "奶油",
        "desc": "将牛奶快速搅拌后提制的奶制品。是制作美味糕点时必备的材料之一。",
        "iconUrl": "https://bbs.hoyolab.com/hoyowiki/picture/object/Cream_icon.png",
        "amount": 3,
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "相关料理"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 4158,
        "name": "奶油蘑菇汤",
        "desc": "<p>随处可见的浓汤。将食材煮熟后打碎成稠液，与奶油一并加热变为浓汤。简简单单就能享受一份热气腾腾的美味，既暖胃又暖心。</p><p></p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2023/09/12/88072335/fc2f0df85700e8516664fe2092589f7e_2707413892660768426.png",
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 4159,
        "name": "奇怪的奶油蘑菇汤",
        "desc": "<p>随处可见的浓汤。抿了一口，还没下咽，却不禁开始祈祷——舌尖传来的怪味，可千万千万不要是泥土的味道啊…</p><p></p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2023/09/12/88072335/76d8b785f683513d17e10bba7a3c1998_4342398055021512634.png",
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 4160,
        "name": "美味的奶油蘑菇汤",
        "desc": "<p>随处可见的浓汤。丝滑温暖的口感，让人感觉仿佛被一条丝绒包裹着，在舞台上旋转跳跃…表演已落幕，无穷的回味却久久不散。</p><p></p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2023/09/12/88072335/71d6cc5e50f0449b7625962eac4a32b2_4577022644190434751.png",
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "水乡肉冻"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "相关食谱"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 4210,
        "name": "食谱：水乡肉冻",
        "desc": "<p><span>步骤详实的食谱，记载着「水乡肉冻」的制作方法。</span></p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2023/08/28/88072335/60c9c277139b43907167e6452d409874_1343251936988952417.png",
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "需要食材"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 1890,
        "name": "鱼肉",
        "desc": "鱼类的新鲜肉块。经过适当处理可以制成让人回味无穷的菜式。",
        "iconUrl": "https://bbs.hoyolab.com/hoyowiki/picture/object/Fish_icon.png",
        "amount": 2,
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 1284,
        "name": "禽肉",
        "desc": "禽类的新鲜肉块。经过适当处理可以制成让人精神一振的佳肴。",
        "iconUrl": "https://bbs.hoyolab.com/hoyowiki/picture/object/Fowl_icon.png",
        "amount": 2,
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 602,
        "name": "奶油",
        "desc": "将牛奶快速搅拌后提制的奶制品。是制作美味糕点时必备的材料之一。",
        "iconUrl": "https://bbs.hoyolab.com/hoyowiki/picture/object/Cream_icon.png",
        "amount": 1,
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "相关料理"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 4199,
        "name": "水乡肉冻",
        "desc": "<p>水产制成的冷菜。将鱼肉打碎成鱼糜，分层放入长方形模具内蒸熟，等凉透后摆盘上桌。虽然是冷菜，却能起到暖场的作用。</p><p></p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2023/09/12/88072335/938045744be10a4f550005af8240b010_752050709026547330.png",
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 4200,
        "name": "奇怪的水乡肉冻",
        "desc": "<p>水产制成的冷菜。如果能完美躲过肉冻中的隐匿陷阱——鱼刺，那么还算是一份不错的开胃小菜。</p><p></p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2023/09/12/88072335/49ef92e1253e5a1b13b100c68f4a3867_3928914205785353135.png",
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 4201,
        "name": "美味的水乡肉冻",
        "desc": "<p>水产制成的冷菜。鱼籽随着肉冻一并在口中炸开，带来惊艳出挑的味觉享受，不消一刻盘子已空空如也。附近没有其他人…偷偷舔一下盘子应该没事吧？</p><p></p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2023/09/12/88072335/284037ad33f8d331b280c93b4165f38d_966469296763492696.png",
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "咖啡芭芭露"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "相关食谱"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 4424,
        "name": "食谱：咖啡芭芭露",
        "desc": "<p><span>步骤详实的食谱，记载着「咖啡芭芭露」的制作方法。</span></p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2023/10/23/88072335/955d23a38b8e91a5e5c9de7547d7a320_9024618265580122379.png",
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "需要食材"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 3623,
        "name": "咖啡豆",
        "desc": "<p>提瓦特常见的植物果实。带有特殊的香气，碾碎后，可用于制作饮品。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2023/03/07/88072335/9c51ecf3f7392e682b23d469892084af_1107533202547434820.png",
        "amount": 4,
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 1104,
        "name": "牛奶",
        "desc": "奶牛的乳汁。香香甜甜，嘴角的那滴也不想放过。",
        "iconUrl": "https://bbs.hoyolab.com/hoyowiki/picture/object/Milk_icon.png",
        "amount": 3,
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 1898,
        "name": "鸟蛋",
        "desc": "拥有无限可能性的禽类的卵，能带来一整天所需的蛋白质。",
        "iconUrl": "https://bbs.hoyolab.com/hoyowiki/picture/object/Bird Egg_icon.png",
        "amount": 3,
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 602,
        "name": "奶油",
        "desc": "将牛奶快速搅拌后提制的奶制品。是制作美味糕点时必备的材料之一。",
        "iconUrl": "https://bbs.hoyolab.com/hoyowiki/picture/object/Cream_icon.png",
        "amount": 2,
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "相关料理"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 4431,
        "name": "奇怪的咖啡芭芭露",
        "desc": "<p>沁凉的甜点。吞下一大口后，浓重的酸苦味刺激得大脑一片空白，大致推断是因为加入了过量咖啡豆。口中的苦味过一会儿应该能平复，现在更需要担心的是今晚的睡眠质量…</p><p></p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2023/10/23/88072335/5738b298a0c4929f0bc1004848d046cf_5434740546621797872.png",
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 4432,
        "name": "咖啡芭芭露",
        "desc": "<p>沁凉的甜点。身为枫丹的代表性甜点，制作方法却十分简单省力，只要食材比例得当几乎不会失败。细腻之余还带有一丝冰凉的口感，能让人瞬间打起精神。</p><p></p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2023/10/23/88072335/dee02ec9fdeacb9cf856f4f5de66b6cc_1553500692000531170.png",
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 4433,
        "name": "美味的咖啡芭芭露",
        "desc": "<p>沁凉的甜点。浓郁的蛋奶香气和醇香的咖啡味道一同在舌尖绽放，更为令人惊艳的是丝滑如绢又不失绵密的口感，不愧是餐厅甜点菜单上长盛不衰的宠儿！</p><p></p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2023/10/23/88072335/77397b011437d526407c992bcd621dbe_2281649758624284088.png",
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "桔桔薄饼"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "相关食谱"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 4430,
        "name": "食谱：桔桔薄饼",
        "desc": "<p><span>步骤详实的食谱，记载着「桔桔薄饼」的制作方法。</span></p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2023/10/23/88072335/955d23a38b8e91a5e5c9de7547d7a320_3219457022336375967.png",
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "需要食材"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 4098,
        "name": "泡泡桔",
        "desc": "<p><span>生长在温暖、湿润、光照充足之处的果实，圆圆的外表下，偷偷藏着甜甜的甘鲜。</span></p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2023/09/05/88072335/6cf3c48d4c41e5ac44723725064d3f85_6662973587425858896.png",
        "amount": 2,
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 602,
        "name": "奶油",
        "desc": "将牛奶快速搅拌后提制的奶制品。是制作美味糕点时必备的材料之一。",
        "iconUrl": "https://bbs.hoyolab.com/hoyowiki/picture/object/Cream_icon.png",
        "amount": 1,
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 947,
        "name": "果酱",
        "desc": "由水果和糖熬制而成的凝胶物质。只要少许就能轻易唤醒疲惫的味蕾。",
        "iconUrl": "https://bbs.hoyolab.com/hoyowiki/picture/object/Jam_icon.png",
        "amount": 1,
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 1737,
        "name": "面粉",
        "desc": "由小麦磨成的粉末。无论做成怎样的主食，都能给食客的胃带来片刻充实。",
        "iconUrl": "https://bbs.hoyolab.com/hoyowiki/picture/object/Flour_icon.png",
        "amount": 1,
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "相关料理"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 4449,
        "name": "奇怪的桔桔薄饼",
        "desc": "<p>带有馅料的薄饼。第一口寡淡得令人担心自己是否失去了味觉，第二口又被甜味齁得宁可味觉立刻消失…如此刺激的体验，宛如在惊涛骇浪中驾驶浪船一般，就算上岸了还是心有余悸。</p><p></p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2023/10/23/88072335/26b98bec5dc2bf21e89e1cf77b14786a_7919030368085251775.png",
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 4450,
        "name": "桔桔薄饼",
        "desc": "<p>带有馅料的薄饼。先煎好饼皮，再加入果酱、奶油和水果切片。其实做法并不单一，根据加入的食材不同，口味也是五花八门。</p><p></p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2023/10/23/88072335/d3b0a404f19a59face44f94586b27a80_8127824273642722259.png",
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 4451,
        "name": "美味的桔桔薄饼",
        "desc": "<p>带有馅料的薄饼。轻盈的奶油与绵密的果酱交织成悠悠乐声，软乎乎的饼皮，仿佛是翩翩荡于其中的裙裾，引得舌尖也忍不住随之起舞。</p><p></p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2023/10/23/88072335/6412c3609eeb6c916dd5788d06fd3b37_6930054844467954601.png",
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "膨膨泡芙"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "相关食谱"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 4596,
        "name": "食谱：膨膨泡芙",
        "desc": "<p>步骤详实的食谱，记载着「膨膨泡芙」的制作方法。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2023/12/09/157749474/955d23a38b8e91a5e5c9de7547d7a320_422153341646171906.png",
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
