        "text": "需要食材"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 1898,
        "name": "鸟蛋",
        "desc": "拥有无限可能性的禽类的卵，能带来一整天所需的蛋白质。",
        "iconUrl": "https://bbs.hoyolab.com/hoyowiki/picture/object/Bird Egg_icon.png",
        "amount": 4,
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 1104,
        "name": "牛奶",
        "desc": "奶牛的乳汁。香香甜甜，嘴角的那滴也不想放过。",
        "iconUrl": "https://bbs.hoyolab.com/hoyowiki/picture/object/Milk_icon.png",
        "amount": 3,
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 1737,
        "name": "面粉",
        "desc": "由小麦磨成的粉末。无论做成怎样的主食，都能给食客的胃带来片刻充实。",
        "iconUrl": "https://bbs.hoyolab.com/hoyowiki/picture/object/Flour_icon.png",
        "amount": 3,
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 602,
        "name": "奶油",
        "desc": "将牛奶快速搅拌后提制的奶制品。是制作美味糕点时必备的材料之一。",
        "iconUrl": "https://bbs.hoyolab.com/hoyowiki/picture/object/Cream_icon.png",
        "amount": 2,
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "相关料理"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 4591,
        "name": "奇怪的膨膨泡芙",
        "desc": "<p>奶油夹心的甜点。由于完成后放置过久，酥皮已经变软了。和想象中的酥脆口感大相径庭，才尝了一口，就想直接判这道甜点「死刑」了。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2023/12/09/157749474/365c8b38488367e2d82329911b4ed5f9_7711663147093125117.png",
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 4586,
        "name": "膨膨泡芙",
        "desc": "<p>奶油夹心的甜点。蓬松的酥皮，包裹着饱满的奶油，圆鼓鼓的，就像膨膨兽的肚皮一样可爱。绵密柔软的奶油能抓住每一个人的心。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2023/12/09/157749474/13e91906ab1188f1ec1355140ee3647a_699637022201666881.png",
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 4590,
        "name": "美味的膨膨泡芙",
        "desc": "<p>奶油夹心的甜点。咬下一口只觉得意犹未尽，忍不住一连吃完了剩下的所有，即使是嘴角的奶油，都能让幸福感涌上胸口：如果每顿饭的餐后甜点都是它，这冒险生活该有多么美妙！</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2023/12/09/157749474/23d950dec1143e784ed6d560ac7faca3_7688527895238700581.png",
