        "desc": "<p>步骤详实的食谱，记载着「膨膨冰淇淋」的制作方法。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2024/08/12/157749474/955d23a38b8e91a5e5c9de7547d7a320_8500105541425886272.png",
